'''Reliance Industrial Infrastructure Limited''', formerly '''Chembur Patalganga Pipelines Limited''', is an industrial infrastructure company based in Mumbai, India. It is a part of [[Reliance Industries]]. It also leases equipment and offers [[IT consulting]] services.<ref>{{cite news |last1=Market |first1=Capital |title=Reliance Industrial Infrastructure consolidated net profit rises 19.56% in the March 2020 quarter |url=https://www.business-standard.com/article/news-cm/reliance-industrial-infrastructure-consolidated-net-profit-rises-19-56-in-the-march-2020-quarter-120042200995_1.html |accessdate=26 April 2020 |work=Business Standard India |date=22 April 2020}}</ref>

